hived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-07-05T06:50:06Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T20:49:07Z","closed_at":"2025-07-15T13:10:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108302","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108302","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108302.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108302.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-15T13:10:21Z"},"body":"I was writing some code with the GLTF module when I noticed that the buffer indices inside of each buffer view was just... completely and totally wrong at export time. Each buffer view had its buffer index set to its own buffer view index.\r\n\r\nThe problem was caused by this line of code:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nr_accessor = bv->buffer = p_state->buffer_views.size();\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis line is utter nonsense. The `bv->buffer` is a buffer index, not a buffer view index. The `r_accessor` is actually a buffer view index... but it's incorrectly named, so I've also fixed that in this PR.\r\n\r\nThis bug was hidden thanks to this loop in the export code:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nfor (GLTFBufferViewIndex i = 0; i < state->buffer_views.size(); i++) {\r\n    state->buffer_views.write[i]->buffer = 0;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis code effectively says... ignore the data in the buffer view, use index 0 always instead. That's just... so bad. Complete and utter nonsense. It completely breaks using any buffer other than 0 and breaks all intermediate export code that tries to take a look at what the buffer view's buffer is.\r\n\r\nI also renamed `_encode_buffer_view` to `_encode_accessor_into_buffer_view` because it's not just buffer views, it also deals heavily with accessor stuff. I also fixed a bug where 16-bit `MAT3`s were being misaligned (`MAT3` is used by nothing in glTF so it went unnoticed until I combed over this code). Also, I improved the comments.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108302/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108302/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}